<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIMON shii Phaul re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phlm</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIMON</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Philimon ne zab re-è ìd pha Masipho ro, yangne ai ne Kholosai charch pha bran ro, chiih-è Onesimus beng pha khiao ro muspho ro. Ji pha khiao ne awai muspho è yoh marui, chiih-è chiihphado ai ne Phaul rog shii ìd rai. Ji pha ishak shii Phaul ne phatheg hà um. Phaul chiang è, Onesimus ne Masipho rey. <char style="bk">Phaul re-è Philimon shii jigi phi pha ji ne</char> Philimon shii awairo khiao shii ò rek phi pha chiang shii zey ro. Phaul re-è Onesimus shii ai hà iidoh thoh din ramuii ro, chiih-è aishii wieho khiao shii khung phi pha duiine asi pha ji shii Masi pha khuiino duiine wieho yi pha Phaul re-è aishii khung.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Philimon shii chiong pha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimus chaing shii khung <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jongsha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Masi Isu chiang phatheg hà rai pha Phaul, chiih-è gethek khuiino Thimothi re-è.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Gethek ijak nane gethek rog shii blia rek pha Philimon, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Khol 4:17</ref></char></note> chiih-è na hò shii charch rekpho chiih-è gethek bumuii Aphia, chiih-è gethek rog pha siphahi Archiphus:<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Gathek Aphuii Hamangkhung-aphuii chiih-è Ithong Isu Masi nathek shii bushun nane liijiing phi.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philimon ro miie nane migi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Khuiino Philimon, idang gu ne sia pha ishak shii, gune na beng soi ne chiih-è gui Hamangkhung-aphuii shii lasothek phi. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Ithong Isu shii naro migi um pha nane Hamangkhung-aphuii ro zab branthek shii na è miie pha ji ne gu è yoi ro. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Gu misia ne hì ro migipohthek duiine gathek ro òsia nathek rog shii nyie gethek ro chai Masi rog shii ò zab khirzey chiang jam ìd pha ji yie ruii phro. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Bushun khuiino, naro miie, re-è gu shii bajoboh lised yie phi chiih-è bajo lububo rek phi! Na è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro zab branthek shii lubuthek re-è sang yie.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Onesimus chiang shii khung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Ji-è hì pha chiang è gu ne Masi shii naro khuiino duiine, nyie rek chid pha ji shii na shii nyayung muii ro. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Jishii nyieliieshii gu na shii miie, ji pha chiang shii gu ne khung. Phaul, gune Masi Isu ro khliie ro, chiih-è thuh shii gune ai chiang shii phathegpho ro, jimagunde gu ne hì pha blia rekramuii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Masi Isu ro khlei ro, chiih-è thuh shii gune ai chiang shii phathegpho; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Firiang, chiih-è Masi Isu, thuh shii gune ai chiang shii phathegpho.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Khol 4:9</ref></char></note> Ji-è Onesimus, hanyie yi Masi shii guiro dufuii ro: Ai chiang è gu na shii khung; gu phatheg hà rai pha ishak ne airo ragung pha aphuii rey dun. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Ishak jia shii ai ne na shii nyie de aphua ro, jishii thuh ai ne phua sha ro,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grekh è Onesimus beng pha miyaosiu “kho.”</char></note> na shii de gu shii de nyimanyi shii phua phro. <verse eid="PHM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Gu thuh aishii iidoh nathek shii thoh ramuii ro, chiih-è ai rog shii guro lubu de wuiiramuii ro. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Gune aishii isa gui rog hà ruii yang shii, muawie chiang è gu phatheg hà rai pha ishak shii, ai ne nathek chiang è gu shii nong phi ro. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Ji è rek magun de, gune na shii nong bone bangchiie arek yang ro; ji phachiang, gune na shii nawailum ji rek bone yang ro. Ji-è gu de na anuii sapho ne gune nyie de arek phro.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Ji rek phade yangne um ruii phro, Onesimus ne ìujia ishak shii na re-è ruang rey dun chiih-è ai ne nathek rog shii idang rai pha dun mua din. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Chiih-è thuh ai ne khiao asi bie ro, jishii khiao re-è de bajo boh ro: ai ne Masi shii bushun khuiino ro. Ai ne gu shii bajo mugak ro! Chiih-è nyimanyi khiao duiine chiih-è Ithong shii ne khuiino duiine na shii ne din ne de huak ne mugak ro! <verse eid="PHM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Ji-è na ne gu shii nawai ijak duiine now arone gu shii wieho pha duiine aishii de iidoh wieho bo. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Ai è na shii ichiig chiih-è nyie muruii um arone gu ibeng shii sasab ruii muii bo. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Thuh, gu ne gui wad rog shii hì zey: <char style="it">Gu, Phaul, na shii iidoh nyaphi din</char> (Gu ne na shii anow din yi phro, nyayao chak arone, nawai ne gu shii phi pha khe sha bie ro.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Ji-è, guro khuiino, Ithong chiang shii gu haro shii hì rek phi bo; Masi shii khuiino duiine, gu shii sang yi bo!<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Gu ne migi, hì pha zey pha duiine, na ne gu è nyie khung pha ji shii rek ruii phro—Zai gu ne thieg na de ji è huàk ne rek muii phro. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Hì pha rog shii gu shii ugud jia saro phi bo, nyieliieshii gu ne ji pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii luthong, ai ne nathek ro zab misiathek shii chang chiih-è gu shii ne nathek shii phi din ruii phro.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha salamthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Khol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref></char>
    </note> Ephaphras, Masi Isu chiang, hanyie è gu rog diig rek ne phatheg hà um pha, ai è de nathek shii salam thoh ge ro, <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12-13:13">Blk 12:12,25—13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37">15:37</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Khol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29-27:2">Blk 19:29—27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Khol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Khol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Thi 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Khol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Thi 4:11</ref></char></note> chiih-è ji-è gu rog bliapho Marg, Aristharkhus, Demas, chiih-è Lug salamthek thoh ge ro. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Ithong Isu Masi ro bushun nathek zab rog shii um bo.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
